{
 "total_seconds": 263.21,
 "segments": [
  {
   "block": 1,
   "text": "How do you build something this big in the middle of the ocean?",
   "idx": 1,
   "file": "/home/hatch/workspace/offshore-platform/audio/segments-s82/seg-001.mp3",
   "duration": 3.744,
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 3.744
  },
  {
   "block": 1,
   "text": "There is no road to the construction site.",
   "idx": 2,
   "file": "/home/hatch/workspace/offshore-platform/audio/segments-s82/seg-002.mp3",
   "duration": 2.76,
   "start": 4.094,
   "end": 6.854
  },
  {
   "block": 1,
   "text": "A ship moves beneath the crane.",
   "idx": 3,
   "file": "/home/hatch/workspace/offshore-platform/audio/segments-s82/seg-003.mp3",
   "duration": 2.424,
   "start": 7.204,
   "end": 9.628
  },
  {
   "block": 1,
   "text": "And the finished platform has to face weather that can stop the entire operation.",
   "idx": 4,
   "file": "/home/hatch/workspace/offshore-platform/audio/segments-s82/seg-004.mp3",
   "duration": 5.064,
   "start": 9.978,
   "end": 15.042
  },
  {
   "block": 1,
   "text": "The answer starts with the enormous structure hidden below the waves.",
   "idx": 5,
   "file": "/home/hatch/workspace/offshore-platform/audio/segments-s82/seg-005.mp3",
   "duration": 4.464,
   "start": 15.392,
   "end": 19.856
  },
  {
   "block": 2,
   "text": "First, a distinction.",
   "idx": 6,
   "file": "/home/hatch/workspace/offshore-platform/audio/segments-s82/seg-006.mp3",
   "duration": 2.184,
   "start": 20.756,
   "end": 22.94
  },
  {
   "block": 2,
   "text": "Some offshore platforms stand on the seabed.",
   "idx": 7,
   "file": "/home/hatch/workspace/offshore-platform/audio/segments-s82/seg-007.mp3",
   "duration": 3.12,
   "start": 23.29,
   "end": 26.41
  },
  {
   "block": 2,
   "text": "Others float.",
   "idx": 8,
   "file": "/home/hatch/workspace/offshore-platform/audio/segments-s82/seg-008.mp3",
   "duration": 1.296,
   "start": 26.76,
   "end": 28.056
  },
  {
   "block": 2,
   "text": "We are following a fixed steel-jacket platform: a deck supported by a braced steel framework, with piles securing it into the ground below.",
   "idx": 9,
   "file": "/home/hatch/workspace/offshore-platform/audio/segments-s82/seg-009.mp3",
   "duration": 9.696,
   "start": 28.406,
   "end": 38.102
  },
  {
   "block": 2,
   "text": "This is one important design, not a blueprint for every offshore structure.",
   "idx": 10,
   "file": "/home/hatch/workspace/offshore-platform/audio/segments-s82/seg-010.mp3",
   "duration": 5.304,
   "start": 38.452,
   "end": 43.756
  },
  {
   "block": 3,
   "text": "Much of the work happens on shore.",
   "idx": 11,
   "file": "/home/hatch/workspace/offshore-platform/audio/segments-s82/seg-011.mp3",
   "duration": 2.424,
   "start": 44.656,
   "end": 47.08
  },
  {
   "block": 3,
   "text": "In a fabrication yard, crews assemble the steel framework and build the equipment modules that will sit above it.",
   "idx": 12,
   "file": "/home/hatch/workspace/offshore-platform/audio/segments-s82/seg-012.mp3",
   "duration": 6.672,
   "start": 47.43,
   "end": 54.102
  },
  {
   "block": 3,
   "text": "Working here allows large sections to be put together before they go offshore.",
   "idx": 13,
   "file": "/home/hatch/workspace/offshore-platform/audio/segments-s82/seg-013.mp3",
   "duration": 4.92,
   "start": 54.452,
   "end": 59.372
  },
  {
   "block": 3,
   "text": "The challenge becomes moving those sections, then connecting them at sea.",
   "idx": 14,
   "file": "/home/hatch/workspace/offshore-platform/audio/segments-s82/seg-014.mp3",
   "duration": 4.68,
   "start": 59.722,
   "end": 64.402
  },
  {
   "block": 4,
   "text": "The jacket and deck modules travel offshore on specialized vessels or barges.",
   "idx": 15,
   "file": "/home/hatch/workspace/offshore-platform/audio/segments-s82/seg-015.mp3",
   "duration": 5.688,
   "start": 65.302,
   "end": 70.99
  },
  {
   "block": 4,
   "text": "Cargo has to be secured for the trip, and the installation team needs suitable conditions at the destination.",
   "idx": 16,
   "file": "/home/hatch/workspace/offshore-platform/audio/segments-s82/seg-016.mp3",
   "duration": 6.624,
   "start": 71.34,
   "end": 77.964
  },
  {
   "block": 4,
   "text": "A giant component can be strong enough for service and still demand extremely careful handling on the way there.",
   "idx": 17,
   "file": "/home/hatch/workspace/offshore-platform/audio/segments-s82/seg-017.mp3",
   "duration": 6.768,
   "start": 78.314,
   "end": 85.082
  },
  {
   "block": 5,
   "text": "At the site, the jacket has to be placed upright on the seabed.",
   "idx": 18,
   "file": "/home/hatch/workspace/offshore-platform/audio/segments-s82/seg-018.mp3",
   "duration": 4.416,
   "start": 85.982,
   "end": 90.398
  },
  {
   "block": 5,
   "text": "Methods vary.",
   "idx": 19,
   "file": "/home/hatch/workspace/offshore-platform/audio/segments-s82/seg-019.mp3",
   "duration": 1.392,
   "start": 90.748,
   "end": 92.14
  },
  {
   "block": 5,
   "text": "Some jackets are launched and then upended; others can be lifted directly from a barge.",
   "idx": 20,
   "file": "/home/hatch/workspace/offshore-platform/audio/segments-s82/seg-020.mp3",
   "duration": 5.88,
   "start": 92.49,
   "end": 98.37
  },
  {
   "block": 5,
   "text": "For our illustration, a crane vessel lifts and positions the jacket.",
   "idx": 21,
   "file": "/home/hatch/workspace/offshore-platform/audio/segments-s82/seg-021.mp3",
   "duration": 4.92,
   "start": 98.72,
   "end": 103.64
  },
  {
   "block": 5,
   "text": "Its movement is controlled throughout the operation.",
   "idx": 22,
   "file": "/home/hatch/workspace/offshore-platform/audio/segments-s82/seg-022.mp3",
   "duration": 3.168,
   "start": 103.99,
   "end": 107.158
  },
  {
   "block": 6,
   "text": "Placing the framework is only part of the job.",
   "idx": 23,
   "file": "/home/hatch/workspace/offshore-platform/audio/segments-s82/seg-023.mp3",
   "duration": 3.36,
   "start": 108.058,
   "end": 111.418
  },
  {
   "block": 6,
   "text": "Steel piles are driven into the seabed to secure the foundation.",
   "idx": 24,
   "file": "/home/hatch/workspace/offshore-platform/audio/segments-s82/seg-024.mp3",
   "duration": 4.224,
   "start": 111.768,
   "end": 115.992
  },
  {
   "block": 6,
   "text": "In this simplified example, they pass through guides at the jacket legs.",
   "idx": 25,
   "file": "/home/hatch/workspace/offshore-platform/audio/segments-s82/seg-025.mp3",
   "duration": 4.824,
   "start": 116.342,
   "end": 121.166
  },
  {
   "block": 6,
   "text": "A cutaway makes the connection visible: deck to framework, framework to piles, piles to the surrounding ground.",
   "idx": 26,
   "file": "/home/hatch/workspace/offshore-platform/audio/segments-s82/seg-026.mp3",
   "duration": 7.8,
   "start": 121.516,
   "end": 129.316
  },
  {
   "block": 7,
   "text": "Now the upper sections can be installed.",
   "idx": 27,
   "file": "/home/hatch/workspace/offshore-platform/audio/segments-s82/seg-027.mp3",
   "duration": 2.616,
   "start": 130.216,
   "end": 132.832
  },
  {
   "block": 7,
   "text": "These are called the topsides: the decks carrying equipment and, on a manned platform, spaces for the crew.",
   "idx": 28,
   "file": "/home/hatch/workspace/offshore-platform/audio/segments-s82/seg-028.mp3",
   "duration": 7.392,
   "start": 133.182,
   "end": 140.574
  },
  {
   "block": 7,
   "text": "Heavy-lift vessels can place large modules onto the support structure.",
   "idx": 29,
   "file": "/home/hatch/workspace/offshore-platform/audio/segments-s82/seg-029.mp3",
   "duration": 4.824,
   "start": 140.924,
   "end": 145.748
  },
  {
   "block": 7,
   "text": "The lift is only one stage; connections, checks and commissioning still have to follow.",
   "idx": 30,
   "file": "/home/hatch/workspace/offshore-platform/audio/segments-s82/seg-030.mp3",
   "duration": 6.144,
   "start": 146.098,
   "end": 152.242
  },
  {
   "block": 8,
   "text": "The finished structure has to be designed for its location and the forces it may face.",
   "idx": 31,
   "file": "/home/hatch/workspace/offshore-platform/audio/segments-s82/seg-031.mp3",
   "duration": 5.448,
   "start": 153.142,
   "end": 158.59
  },
  {
   "block": 8,
   "text": "Its steel frame is part of that response, but engineering does not make a platform invincible.",
   "idx": 32,
   "file": "/home/hatch/workspace/offshore-platform/audio/segments-s82/seg-032.mp3",
   "duration": 6.24,
   "start": 158.94,
   "end": 165.18
  },
  {
   "block": 8,
   "text": "Inspections, maintenance and weather planning remain essential.",
   "idx": 33,
   "file": "/home/hatch/workspace/offshore-platform/audio/segments-s82/seg-033.mp3",
   "duration": 4.68,
   "start": 165.53,
   "end": 170.21
  },
  {
   "block": 8,
   "text": "Construction weather and survival weather are very different problems.",
   "idx": 34,
   "file": "/home/hatch/workspace/offshore-platform/audio/segments-s82/seg-034.mp3",
   "duration": 4.512,
   "start": 170.56,
   "end": 175.072
  },
  {
   "block": 9,
   "text": "There is also a human side to the design.",
   "idx": 35,
   "file": "/home/hatch/workspace/offshore-platform/audio/segments-s82/seg-035.mp3",
   "duration": 3.048,
   "start": 175.972,
   "end": 179.02
  },
  {
   "block": 9,
   "text": "A manned platform needs places to work, rest and gather in an emergency.",
   "idx": 36,
   "file": "/home/hatch/workspace/offshore-platform/audio/segments-s82/seg-036.mp3",
   "duration": 5.016,
   "start": 179.37,
   "end": 184.386
  },
  {
   "block": 9,
   "text": "The deck is a workplace with routes, boundaries and limited space.",
   "idx": 37,
   "file": "/home/hatch/workspace/offshore-platform/audio/segments-s82/seg-037.mp3",
   "duration": 4.56,
   "start": 184.736,
   "end": 189.296
  },
  {
   "block": 9,
   "text": "Equipment and accommodation have to share that space without turning every journey across it into an obstacle course.",
   "idx": 38,
   "file": "/home/hatch/workspace/offshore-platform/audio/segments-s82/seg-038.mp3",
   "duration": 7.248,
   "start": 189.646,
   "end": 196.894
  },
  {
   "block": 10,
   "text": "When severe weather threatens, protecting people can mean shutting in production and evacuating ahead of the storm.",
   "idx": 39,
   "file": "/home/hatch/workspace/offshore-platform/audio/segments-s82/seg-039.mp3",
   "duration": 6.768,
   "start": 197.794,
   "end": 204.562
  },
  {
   "block": 10,
   "text": "The decisions depend on forecasts, the facility and its emergency plan.",
   "idx": 40,
   "file": "/home/hatch/workspace/offshore-platform/audio/segments-s82/seg-040.mp3",
   "duration": 5.16,
   "start": 204.912,
   "end": 210.072
  },
  {
   "block": 10,
   "text": "Escape and rescue arrangements matter too.",
   "idx": 41,
   "file": "/home/hatch/workspace/offshore-platform/audio/segments-s82/seg-041.mp3",
   "duration": 3.168,
   "start": 210.422,
   "end": 213.59
  },
  {
   "block": 10,
   "text": "A dramatic storm shot should never imply that a helicopter can simply arrive in any conditions.",
   "idx": 42,
   "file": "/home/hatch/workspace/offshore-platform/audio/segments-s82/seg-042.mp3",
   "duration": 6.384,
   "start": 213.94,
   "end": 220.324
  },
  {
   "block": 11,
   "text": "In deeper water, the answer may be a floating system instead of a fixed jacket.",
   "idx": 43,
   "file": "/home/hatch/workspace/offshore-platform/audio/segments-s82/seg-043.mp3",
   "duration": 5.256,
   "start": 221.224,
   "end": 226.48
  },
  {
   "block": 11,
   "text": "A semi-submersible gets support from its buoyant hull and uses a mooring system to hold position.",
   "idx": 44,
   "file": "/home/hatch/workspace/offshore-platform/audio/segments-s82/seg-044.mp3",
   "duration": 6.528,
   "start": 226.83,
   "end": 233.358
  },
  {
   "block": 11,
   "text": "It is not standing on legs that reach the bottom.",
   "idx": 45,
   "file": "/home/hatch/workspace/offshore-platform/audio/segments-s82/seg-045.mp3",
   "duration": 3.456,
   "start": 233.708,
   "end": 237.164
  },
  {
   "block": 11,
   "text": "Different conditions lead engineers toward different structures.",
   "idx": 46,
   "file": "/home/hatch/workspace/offshore-platform/audio/segments-s82/seg-046.mp3",
   "duration": 3.84,
   "start": 237.514,
   "end": 241.354
  },
  {
   "block": 12,
   "text": "So the building above the waves is only the visible part of the project.",
   "idx": 47,
   "file": "/home/hatch/workspace/offshore-platform/audio/segments-s82/seg-047.mp3",
   "duration": 4.728,
   "start": 242.254,
   "end": 246.982
  },
  {
   "block": 12,
   "text": "For a fixed jacket platform, fabrication on land, transport at sea, a piled foundation and carefully planned lifts all have to fit together.",
   "idx": 48,
   "file": "/home/hatch/workspace/offshore-platform/audio/segments-s82/seg-048.mp3",
   "duration": 10.368,
   "start": 247.332,
   "end": 257.7
  },
  {
   "block": 12,
   "text": "What looks like a building in the ocean is a structure connected to the ground beneath it.",
   "idx": 49,
   "file": "/home/hatch/workspace/offshore-platform/audio/segments-s82/seg-049.mp3",
   "duration": 5.16,
   "start": 258.05,
   "end": 263.21
  }
 ]
}